<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95303" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῡλ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip</i> or <i>despoil a slain enemy</i>, esp. of his
			arms (taking off the clothes also is condemned by <i><span class="en">Pl.,
					<u>R.</u>469c</span></i>), not in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>; c. acc. pers. et rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύκνον σκυλεύσαντες ἀπ᾽ ὤμων τεύχεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					468
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τοὺς τελευτήσαντας πλὴν ὅπλων</span>
			<i>strip</i> of anything but arms, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> l.c.; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίσβαιναν] δέρματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					379
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. pers. only, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τοὺς νεκρούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.82
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.44
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				97
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				51.148
			</span></i> (Salamis <i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὰς πόλεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.10.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. rei et
			gen. pers., <i>strip</i> the arms <i>off</i> an enemy, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλα</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πολεμίων ς.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					12.40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.1.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῶν . . νεκρῶν ς. ψέλια
			κτλ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.80
			</span></i>.</div>
